 Warm-up 300yd: 200 easy freestyle + 100 easy backstroke or freestyle\, no 
 gear.\nTechnique 4x50=200yd: 25 single-arm freestyle + 25 normal freestyle
 \; alternate arms\; no gear.\nBuoy comparison 8x50=400yd: odd repeats with
  pull buoy\, even normal freestyle\; rest 20s\, same effort. Record pace a
 nd strokes per 25yd.\nAerobic main set 4x200=800yd: normal freestyle\, res
 t 25s\, RPE 5\, smooth continuous strokes.\nCatch awareness 4x50=200yd: fi
 rst 2x50 small paddles OPTIONAL\, last 2x50 normal freestyle\, rest 25s. S
 kip paddles if shoulders uncomfortable.\nCooldown 200yd easy freestyle\, n
 o gear.\nKey focus: relaxed recovery\, neutral head\, begin next catch wit
 hout exaggerated pause. Do not chase lower stroke count.\nBIKE 60min: 10 e
 asy + 40 comfortable Z2 (RPE 3-4/10) + 10 easy. Seated\, avoid hard standi
 ng climbs.\nNO FINS\; gentle wall push-offs\; stop provoking calf symptoms
 .\nDaily totals: Swim 2100yd\; Bike 60min\; Run 0min\; Walk 0min\; Strengt
 h 0min.\nIf calf pain\, limp\, swelling or next-day worsening: stop/reduce
  and contact PT as appropriate. Follow PT rehab exactly. No CSS/FTP/5k tes
 ts this week.
